  "description": "End-to-end alignment pipeline for paired-end Illumina data. Run fastp to pre-process input FASTQ files and remove polyG artifacts. Run Sentieon BWA-MEM for alignment, incorporate read groups, mark duplicate reads, and recalibrate base and indel scores. Sort the alignment BAM files by coordinates. Merge the aligned BAM files. Calculate quality metrics. Implemented to run in distributed mode and processing reads by lane, per single sample and library. Build hg38/GRCh38",
